{"_v":1,"id":"hamilton-west-end-2021","bd":{"positive":12,"mixed":0,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Michael Billington","o":"The Guardian","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2017/dec/21/hamilton-review-musical-london-victoria-palace-lin-manuel-miranda","d":"2017-12-23","q":"Above all, Miranda has created an invigorating and original musical that, at a time of national crisis, celebrates America’s overwhelming debt to the immigrant."},{"cn":"Dominic Cavendish","o":"The Telegraph","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/hamilton-west-end-review-believe-every-single-word-hype/","d":"2017-12-22","q":"It really is as good as we’ve been told."},{"cn":"Henry Hitchings","o":"Evening Standard","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/go/london/theatre/hamilton-review-believe-the-hype-linmanuel-mirandas-musical-is-a-knockout-a3725301.html","d":"2017-12-21","q":"'Hamilton' is a knockout, and its cast is superb"},{"cn":"Ann Treneman","o":"The Times (UK)","s":92,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/edition/news/theatre-review-hamilton-at-victoria-palace-sw1-xdshn0nhs","d":"2017-12-22","q":"Thomas Kail directs what is a blockbuster."},{"cn":"Matt Trueman","o":"Variety","s":90,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2017/legit/reviews/hamilton-review-london-west-end-1202647480/","q":"\"Hamilton\" lands on the London stage looking every inch the classic."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2018/01/05/theater/review-hamilton-conquers-london-king-george-slays-too.html","q":"“Hamilton,” it seems — especially as led by its incendiary newborn star, Mr. Westman — can make a traitor of any English citizen for a night."},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":95,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/london-theatre/reviews/hamilton-victoria-palace-theatre-lin-manuel-miranda_45423.html","d":"2017-12-21","q":"If anything, it is slightly better than I thought it might be – a heart-breaking work of staggering genius that changes the form of musical theatre for ever."},{"cn":"Sarah Hemming","o":"Financial Times","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.ft.com/content/9be5e262-e637-11e7-8b99-0191e45377ec","d":"2017-12-21","q":"But it is also a blast: a playful and dazzling work of art, expertly delivered here by a tremendous new cast."},{"cn":"Mark Shenton","o":"London Theatre","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/review-hamilton-is-here-to-stay-at-the-victoria-palace-theatre","d":"2022-01-25","q":"Read our five-star review of Hamilton at the Victoria Palace Theatre. This review refers to the original cast, including Jamael Westman and Giles Terera."},{"cn":"Tim Bano","o":"The Stage","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/2017/hamilton-review-victoria-palace-lin-manuel-miranda-theatre-london/","d":"2017-12-21","q":"It’s zeitgeist, youthquake, Momentum, it’s woke, it’s post-musical."},{"cn":"Paul Taylor","o":"The Independent","s":92,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/hamilton-victoria-palace-theatre-london-review-a-magnificent-achievement-thomas-kail-the-book-of-a8122091.html","d":"2017-12-21","q":"This is obviously a magnificent achievement that on no account is to be missed."},{"cn":"Bernadette McNulty","o":"The i","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://inews.co.uk/culture/arts/hamilton-victoria-palace-theatre-review-dazzlingly-inventive-112463?srsltid=AfmBOop4kC9sQg9x7FFnDbT5leqt90C7BMWuYiYhNsWms6zgGUdVnjXs","q":"Even though Hamilton then is preaching to the converted, it is still a dazzlingly inventive piece of musical theatre."}],"au":{"score":92,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"mz":{"s":92,"c":6182,"sr":4.6}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/3fHQ41gqlpwWBHcawW3OIZ/33c9b17158e0cfa84cb2971d74ed7583/Hamilton_-_Hero?fm=webp&q=90","ca":[{"n":"Declan Spaine","r":"Alexander Hamilton"},{"n":"Ava Brennan","r":"Angelica Schuyler"},{"n":"Simbi Akande","r":"Peggy Schuyler/Maria Reynolds"},{"n":"Dom Hartley-Harris","r":"George Washington"},{"n":"Lemuel Knights","r":"Marquis De Lafayette/Thomas Jefferson"},{"n":"Simon-Anthony Rhoden","r":"Aaron Burr"},{"n":"Shan Ako","r":"Eliza Hamilton"},{"n":"Emile Ruddock","r":"Hercules Mulligan/James Madison"},{"n":"Jake Halsey-Jones","r":"John Laurens/Philip Hamilton"},{"n":"Joel Montague","r":"King George III"},{"n":"Alex Sawyer","r":"Alexander Hamilton"}]}